    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enjung'ore oo nkituaak naayama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, oo lmareita loo layiok le Gilead, olayioni le Makir, olayioni le Manase o loo nkajijik oo loo menye oo layiok le Yosef, nepuonu aanyiku neiro te dukuya Musa o te dukuya larikok, nena lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye oo ltung'ana le Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 27.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nejo ninche, “Eitanapa apa Olaitoriani olkitok lai pee eishooyo enkop anaa enjung'ore te oshoto e nkukuo aisho iltung'ana le Israel, neitanapaki apa olkitok lai o Laitoriani pee eisho enjung'ore e Selofehad olalashe lang ntoyie enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tenaa keyama ninche obo ake ninye loo layiok le kulie oshon loo ltung'ana le Israel ore naa enjung'ore enye neyae aaitung'uaa enjung'ore oo loo papa, neponikini ina jung'ore e ilo osho ora olenye; neaku keiwuang'ieki te oshoto enkukuo e ina jung'ore ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te nebau ilo sirua loo ltung'ana le Israel odamunyeki ilarin onom, neitokini aaponaa enjung'ore enye aaponiki ilo osho ora olenye; ore enjung'ore enye neyai aaitung'uaa enjung'ore olosho loo loopapa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitanap Musa iltung'ana le Israel te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani, ejo, “Etisipa olosho loo layiok le Yosef. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye eitanapisho Olaitoriani ti alo nena toyie e Selofehad, ‘Nchoo ninche meyama oloba anaa oladol aajo sidai, kake nchoo ake duoo eyami ti atua ilmarei lo losho loo loo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enjung'ore oo ltung'ana le Israel nemeibelekenyi to losho obo aaya olikae osho, amu ore pooki ng'ae too ltung'ana le Israel neibung'are enjung'ore o losho loo loo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore entito pooki ake naata enjung'ore te pooki ake ninye osho loo ltung'ana le Israel naa kelo aaku enkitok e obo lo losho lolmarei le menye, pee aa ore pooki ng'ae too ltung'ana le Israel netum anoto enjung'ore oo loomenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa meetae enjung'ore naibelekenyi aaitung'uaa olosho obo aaya olikae; amu ore ake pooki osho loo tung'ana le Israel neibung'are enjung'ore enye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena toyie e Selofehad neas anaa enaitanapa Olaitoriani Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu ore Mahalal, o Tirsa, o Hogla, o Mika o Noa, nena toyie e Selofehad neyama layiok loo lalashera le menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyamaki apa ninche too lmareita loo layiok le Manase olayioni le Yosef, ore enjung'ore enye neton to losho lo lmarei le papaai lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna ninche nkitanapat o nkiguanat apa naaitanapa Olaitoriani Musa te nkaraki iltung'ana le Israel, too nkisiajat e Moab, te mbata olkeju le Yordan etalita Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
